n demand. She says the customer base is still broad.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "CNBC Television", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GnAPgmO73ZI", "date": "2026-11-18T02:32:29Z"}]}, {"text": "Nvidia's strong earnings lifted AI stocks, but the gains did not last. Markets swung sharply and some turned negative.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "couriernews.com", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-18T15:37:20Z"}, {"name": "BigGo Finance", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBjU2xabDd3TWpEd0h0UFc4aHJMdTdJaERITVk3NlpfN1R2MkpiVkdjRC1lWVZCRGZuSWJzV3N0ejBZeS05M29CX2lDSlIwbXJPTkFoY0RGa1VHdTVnNFBPd1N6NlZHNmFDNXd3SEVuRWZfWHp3OVE?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-18T15:25:00Z"}, {"name": "KTVN", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-18T14:43:46Z"}]}, {"text": "Anthropic's IPO is set to begin trading on Nasdaq as ANT on Thursday. Sources say the price may come in above the $70 to $78 range.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "CNBC Technology", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/18/anthropic-ipo-ai-offering-price.html", "date": "2026-11-18T15:19:53Z"}, {"name": "CNBC Television", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XfSpfpyH7jE", "date": "2026-11-17T16:33:18Z"}]}, {"text": "Huang says he owns his mistakes. He will cooperate with the board's investigation into his ties to an alleged Chinese intelligence-linked executive.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "CNBC Television", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A-twzOs2S5A", "date": "2026-11-17T17:15:13Z"}, {"name": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DaniVdpOKJ0", "date": "2026-11-17T17:09:37Z"}, {"name": "Bloomberg Television", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FLWIkeiyE8A", "date": "2026-11-17T23:01:34Z"}]}], "updated": "2026-11-18T16:11:11Z"}}